      <p>You don't need expensive software to forecast better. Start with a 90-day rolling average of daily sales velocity per SKU. Add your supplier lead time. Multiply velocity by lead time to get your reorder point. Add a safety stock buffer of 10–20% for variability. That's your trigger.</p>
